### My dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/meAPI?api_token={{apiToken}}

### My work (partner view)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/meWork?api_token={{apiToken}}

### My classes
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/class?api_token={{apiToken}}

### Students for item
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/students/1?api_token={{apiToken}}

### My locations
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/locations?api_token={{apiToken}}

### My categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/categories?api_token={{apiToken}}

### Enrolled courses
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/auth/study?api_token={{apiToken}}

### Study detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/auth/study/1?api_token={{apiToken}}

### Cart count
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/auth/cart?api_token={{apiToken}}
